{'symbol': 'SEE', 'date': '2022-06-07 09:00:00', 'title': 'DIGIMARC AND SEALED AIR PARTNER TO TRANSFORM THE CONSUMER GOODS INDUSTRY THROUGH SMART PACKAGING', 'text': 'GLOBAL BRANDS CAN NOW BENEFIT FROM THE POWER OF PRODUCT DIGITIZATION AT SCALE BEAVERTON, ORE. , JUNE 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 DIGIMARC CORPORATION \xa0(NASDAQ: DMRC)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY HAS PARTNERED WITH GLOBAL DIGITAL PRINTING AND DIGITAL PACKAGING LEADER, SEALED AIR\xa0(NYSE: SEE), TO BRING PRODUCT DIGITIZATION TO MARKETS LIKE FOOD PROTEINS, ECOMMERCE FULFILLMENT, INDUSTRIALS, AND CONSUMER GOODS AT SCALE THROUGH SMART PACKAGING.'}